        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.914` **Asset Lookup's offline messages** \u2014 a dispatched `offline` event (`useNetwork`).\n- `Building 0000`: the Readings tab becomes **`This feature requires an internet connection.`** (not its online empty state) and a\n  never-loaded Work History tab shows the same message.\n- `Tank 0000`: with its readings loaded online, `Add reading types` offline opens the message popover\n  (`EventReadings.tsx:300`), not the add-types modal.\n- `Tank 0000`: the photo menu's `Get Description` is disabled offline \u2014 its click opens the message\n  instead of posting to the AI route. \ud83d\uded1 Clicked only while the offline icon shows; nothing else in\n  the menu is ever touched.\n- \ud83d\uded1 READ-ONLY. `online` is restored `always` and the page reloaded.",
